  "explode.open": "Open Folder",
  "settings.help": "Help",
  "settings.help_text": "## Quick Start\n\nMaking your first mod with this tool:\n\n1. Open \"Settings\" → Root Profiles → create a new profile (game folder + your mod folder) → right-click \"Reload This Profile\";\n2. Open \"Comprehensive\" → edit/add content under Edicts / Decisions / Static Modifiers / Strategic Resources (right form);\n3. Click \"Save\" to write explicitly (nothing auto-saves); use \"Refresh\" to discard unsaved changes.\n\n## Official Modding Docs\n\n[Official documentation & tutorials](https://main--pdxdoc-next.netlify.app)\n\n## Comprehensive · Edicts/Decisions (field meanings)\n\n- **Icon**: icon shown in game\n- **Length**: -1 infinite / a number (years·months)\n- **Resources**: startup cost / monthly upkeep / monthly produces\n- **Potential**: when it is visible; **Allow**: when it can be clicked\n- **Effect**: what actually happens; **modifier**: numeric changes\n- **AI weight**: chance the AI uses it (0 = never)\n- **Owner file**: which txt to save to (file name only, prefix auto-added)\n\n## Comprehensive · Static Modifiers (field meanings)\n\n- **Hidden**: not shown in the country list; **Important**: mark as important; **Icon frame**: icon frame style index\n- **Custom tooltip**: custom hover text (value is a localisation key); **Show only custom tooltip**: hide the normal description\n- **Bonus grid**: the numeric bonuses of this static modifier (double-click a cell to edit)\n\n## Comprehensive · Strategic Resources\n\nThree-column rows = key (field) / value (pick or custom) / source (which file); the Save button left of the search box writes everything.\n\n## Technology (field meanings)\n\n- **Tier**: research level (determines position); **Cost**: research points\n- **Levels**: repeatable research count (-1 = infinite); **Cost per level**: extra cost each repeat\n- **Prerequisites**: technologies required first; **modifier**: numeric gains; **Rare / Dangerous**: border color (purple / red)\n\n## Maps\n\n- \"Maps\" tab = Dynamic/Static maps stacked whole-page (list click switches type); \"Galaxy Styles\" tab = the style page\n- Style parameters = shape / star count / distribution (Shape, Other, Color tabs)\n- Right editor width / list height draggable and shared across the three pages\n\n## Index\n\n- Language: look up localisation by key (dedup, detail component); Modifiers: modifier dictionary (localisation component, real key); Sprites: gfx texture index (registered + unreferenced paths, frame-sliced preview)\n- Column widths shared across the three pages\n\n## Settings\n\n- **Root profiles**: root presets (game + mod folders); **Mod prefix**: localisation file prefix\n- **Reload This Profile**: rebuild with current folders; **Import Launcher Set**: import playlists from the launcher DB; **Interface language**: Chinese / English",
  "settings.about": "About",
  "settings.help_roots": "• Load Profiles: create multiple root presets (Default is the initial one); switching profiles reloads with that profile; empty profiles use the hidden sandbox folder next to the exe.",
  "settings.help_lang": "• Interface language: pick the UI language (shown in its own name); switching refreshes the whole UI.",
  "settings.help_style": "• Galaxy Styles: add/delete/copy/rename styles, tune shape parameters, right-click delete, drag reorder; save exports preview/button images to sprite paths.",
  "settings.help_map": "• Dynamic/Static maps: mixed list with two-way switching; left editor supports add points / delete / box-select / multi-drag / mirror / rotate / hyperlanes.",
  "settings.help_export": "• Export settings: export preview/icon per style; static map 'generate preview/icon' renders the designed point set.",
  "settings.help_save": "• Save: unified save (spinner, failure-only dialog); saving is always user-triggered.",
  "settings.help_normalize": "• Normalize All: automated fixes (localisation key migration / gfx fixes), memory only; written on save.",
  "settings.help_profiles": "• Profile nav: right-click new/rename/delete/reload profile; current profile dirs are saved live on add/remove/reorder.",
  "settings.help_sandbox": "• sandbox: hidden fallback folder (next to exe) when no roots are set; closing with empty custom roots shows a notice.",
